# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Benchmark results written by the paisho server (its default logdir; see `src/results.rs`).
# They are generated output, one JSON file per episode, and can be large and specific to
# whoever ran the benchmark, so they don't belong in version control.
runs/
